<se id="1" src="男立ち去り2" mode="normal" loop="off">
<bgm src="s08" mode="fadein" old="fadeout" time="10" COUNT="1;-1" LOOP="on">
  The moon is brighter than usual, allowing Koji to walk through the front yard without tripping on debris. Staying alert, he heads for the building beyond the mountains of trash.<K>
  Something must be buried underneath the piles of garbage, because the whole yard is filled with the sharp stink of chemicals.<K>
  Even the homeless probably wouldn't come to this place. If you need to get out of the wind and rain, there are plenty of shelters more suitable.

